  "intro_en": "Start here with no German. Follow Jakob from a Heidelberg laboratory to the dye works across the Rhine. Read for what happens; reread a passage if you need to. Tap a word for its gloss when available, and use the margin aids. English grammar notes after each chapter explain the patterns you have met. The workbook and Pensa practise them; Anki can help with memorisation. There is no audio. Scientific readings grow from supported quotations into annotated originals."
